The Ariadne port changes the implementation language to Python, uses immutable
values and archive-scoped source references, and excludes UniiChat's UI, provider
clients, worker pool and filesystem layout. Its fixture generator executes the
pinned upstream pure functions; it is not the full UniiChat application.
